    "notes": "All 12 views inspected plus a full-size left orbit to check the small pieces. Teapot, lidded sugar bowl, creamer, cups and plates are each individually modelled with hollow interiors and correct rims; the close orbit confirms the grey floral transfer and gold rim lines stay sharp at 2k. Topology is heavier than needed on the plates, hence the 4.",
    "limitations": [
      "Supplied as a wide display layout of many pieces; the whole-set framing makes individual items small on the contact sheet.",
      "40k triangles for the full set; separate and decimate the plates if you only need one piece."
    ],
